    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53029" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμψα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ης</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>basket, case</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάψα</span></b>  (cf. Lat. <i>capsa</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>:—
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμψίον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				6ii90
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:— also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμψάκης</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καψάκης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <i>cruse, flask</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ju.</u>
					10.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				17.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλιτος καψάκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.428.64
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				12.107
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμψάκιον</span></b> , τό,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				387ii 19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, Cumont <i>Fouilles de Doura-Europos</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				372
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καψάκιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
